      "artwork_id": "getty-103rfp",
      "source_id": "musebridge-103rfp-guide",
      "source_locator": "MuseBridge guide note 1",
      "excerpt": "Find the grapes in the woman’s hand, then look down to the left for the smaller bunch in the ape’s paw. Move your gaze between the two bunches. How does the repeated gesture change which figure you notice first?",
